This document describes how to install the meldtech_installer_X.YZ.tgz package

1) Decompress the tgz file in a directory accessible by the XC4208 by running:
	tar -xzvf meldtech_installer_<version>.tgz
	<version> is the version of the package as the file name indicates
2) In the XC4208, go to the meldtech directory where the files were unpacked
	cd <path>/meldtech
	<path> is the path to the directory where meldtech_installer_<version>.tgz was copied to
3) Run the installer script from the XC4208
	./installer.sh
4) Once the installer has finished, reboot the XC4208

NOTES: The installation files can normally be accessed by mounting a USB drive or an NFS drive.

****************************************************************
NFS Example:

If the installer package is in an nfs shared drive (i.e. /opt/nfs) on a Linux server and the drive was mounted to /nfs on the XC4208, do the following:
1) On the Linux server:
	cd /opt/nfs
	tar -xvzf meldtech_installer_1.11.tgz
2) On the XC4208:
	cd /nfs/meldtech
3) ./installer.sh
4) reboot
